    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d152-a14">

                <pb facs="0558" n="436" sameAs="frus:frus1889/pg436"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 14 in No. 1049.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. White to Mr.
                            McLelan</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Shelburne</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1887-09-14"><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 14,
                        1887</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Allen will not proceed with general repairs unless <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bridgewater</hi> released; been here four weeks, and about leaving for New
                    York; protests show necessity for prompt decision: when may we expect it?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">N. W. White</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">United States Consular Agent.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
